{"id":"leichnam","lemma":"Leichnam","pos":"noun","rank":4988,"glosses":["corpse (dead human body)"],"ipa":"/ˈlaɪ̯çˌnaːm/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/01/De-Leichnam.ogg/De-Leichnam.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Leichnams","plural":"Leichname"},"examples":[{"text":"Sein Leichnam wurde nie gefunden.","en":"His body was never found.","words":[{"g":"to be"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"never, never at all"},{"g":"found, located"}]},{"text":"Wir haben in der Ruine einen Leichnam gefunden.","en":"We found a corpse in the ruins.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"ruin, ruins"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"found, located"}]},{"text":"Er hüpfte von einem Leichnam zum nächsten.","en":"He jumped from one subject to another.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to hop","l":"hüpfen"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"(to) a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"near","l":"nah"}]},{"text":"Der Leichnam weist an der Brust eine Schussverletzung auf.","en":"The corpse has a gunshot wound in the chest.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to indicate","l":"weisen"},{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"chest"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"gunshot wound"},{"g":"on"}]}]}